      "role": "user",
      "content": "Our 96 brain RNA-seq samples (about 20,000 genes) were processed in four extraction batches and I want the batch effect removed. Depending on who you ask in the lab, that means a batch-corrected expression matrix to hand to other people, or batch-adjusted gene co-expression to build the regulatory network on, and I'm not sure which one I'm supposed to deliver. Batch is recorded per sample as numeric indicator columns."
    },
